  "answer": "Final Response: Software requirement: iOS 17.1 or later. AirDrop's ability to continue a transfer over the internet after you move out of Bluetooth/Wi-Fi range was added in the iOS 17.1 update (Apple's iOS 17.1 release notes: 'AirDrop - Content continues to transfer over the internet when you step out of AirDrop range'; Apple Support iPhone AirDrop guide: 'If you leave Bluetooth or Wi-Fi range after an AirDrop transfer is initiated, the transfer continues over the internet'). It is available on all iPhone models that can run iOS 17.1, i.e., iPhone XS, iPhone XS Max, iPhone XR and later (iPhone 11/12/13/14/15 series and iPhone SE 2nd generation or later).",
